{"id":5935,"date":"2021-02-18T13:16:57","date_gmt":"2021-02-18T12:16:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=5935"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:01:49","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:01:49","slug":"dechets-dangereux-des-menages","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/dechets-dangereux-des-menages\/","title":{"rendered":"Les d\u00e9chets dangereux font mauvais m\u00e9nage"},"content":{"rendered":"<div><strong>Dans la famille des d\u00e9chets, les\u00a0produits domestiques, d\u2019entretien ou de bricolage comme les restes de peinture, les pesticides, les insecticides, les solvants, les d\u00e9capants sont dangereux et non\u00a0collect\u00e9s avec les ordures m\u00e9nag\u00e8res. Ils ne doivent en aucun cas \u00eatre rejet\u00e9s au r\u00e9seau d\u2019assainissement.\u00a0<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-5936 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/MIEUX-LES-UTILISER3.-MIEUX-LES-JETER-143x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/MIEUX-LES-UTILISER3.-MIEUX-LES-JETER-143x300.png 143w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/MIEUX-LES-UTILISER3.-MIEUX-LES-JETER-489x1024.png 489w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/MIEUX-LES-UTILISER3.-MIEUX-LES-JETER-300x629.png 300w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/MIEUX-LES-UTILISER3.-MIEUX-LES-JETER-52x110.png 52w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/MIEUX-LES-UTILISER3.-MIEUX-LES-JETER-63x133.png 63w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/MIEUX-LES-UTILISER3.-MIEUX-LES-JETER.png 688w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 143px) 100vw, 143px\" \/><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>Retrouvez les informations sur le traitement de ces d\u00e9chets sur le site\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/objectifz.strasbourg.eu\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/dechets-dangereux-des-menages.pdf\">internet de l\u2019Eurom\u00e9tropole<\/a>.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>Rendez-vous sur\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/objectifz.strasbourg.eu\/\">objectifz.strasbourg.eu<\/a>\u00a0pour plus d&rsquo;informations.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>T\u00e9l\u00e9chargez la plaquette informative :\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/EMS-Plaquette-DDM-100x210-2021_web.pdf\">EMS Plaquette D\u00e9chets Dangereux des M\u00e9nages<\/a><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>\n<div>Num\u00e9ro info-d\u00e9chets : <strong>03 68 98 51 90<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>\n<p>Renseignements\u00a0:<\/p>\n<table width=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"175\"><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"156\">SUEZ STRASBOURG<\/p>\n<p>1b place Henry Levy<br \/>\n(port du Rhin)<\/p>\n<p>03 88 60 05 64<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"180\">SUEZ STRASBOURG<\/p>\n<p>22 rue de Cherbourg*<br \/>\n(Neuhof)<\/p>\n<p>03 88 66 14 03<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"170\">ENVIE STRASBOURG<\/p>\n<p>6 rue Herrade<br \/>\n(Koenigshoffen)<\/p>\n<p>03 88 10 04 30<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"175\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Lundi<\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"156\">8h30-12h30<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"180\">13h30-17h30<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"170\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Ferm\u00e9<\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"175\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Mardi<\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"156\">Ferm\u00e9<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"180\">Ferm\u00e9<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"170\">Ferm\u00e9<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" w